  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Newborn, Women and Children - Saving Lives through access to essential health commodities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to the Reproductive, Maternal, Newborn and Child Health Trust Fund to support high-burden countries to scale up availability and access for the essential health commodities to save the lives of women in pregnancy and childbirth as well as children under five.</narrative>
  </description>
